c v2.33/Mar99-PAS: clean out green fcn stuff used for impurity code;
c    tighten memory use in eigensolver routines.
c v2.32/Mar99-PAS: charged periodic systems; with Madelung correction;
c    periodic WS dipole calculation
c v2.31/Feb99-PAS: scale up: real eigensolver; nearby arrays from wk;
