c v2.30/Jan99-PAS: box up ion/dipole code; clean force arrays;
c    redo symmetry (group generation, reduced symmetry);
c    split out es grid force into own routine ("eslofrc")
c v2.29/Dec98-PAS: promote source to explicit double precision
c v2.28/Nov98-PAS: single precision grid orbitals
