c    rework logical structure of local 3ctr forces; change es boundary
c    conditions; full ionic/dipole corrections for finite clusters;
c    inter-slab dipole correction; geometry restart
c v2.26/Sep98-PAS: on-the-fly grid orbitals
c v2.25/Aug98-PAS: modify local 3-center integral routines: purge
