c v2.22/Apr98-PAS: fix some geom options bugs; geom scf accelerator
c v2.21/Sep97-PAS: combine big arrays into single workspace;
c    restart blend after some specified iteration; geometry relaxation!!
c    allow/treat correctly zero-weight k-pts; clean/reduce diagnostics;
