c    Separate out nearby stuff from "vslomat" (new routines "grdovlp"
c    and "atdefct"), revise corresponding energies (new comprehensive
c    routine "doengy"). Rework atom xc-potential cutoff scheme and add
c    new atom-subtracted matrix Exc energy evaluation. Fuss with enij.
c v2.06/Mar94-PAS: generally dimension norbd/natmd/nkd/nstd arrays.
c    Install phantom xc atom force.  Clean version transmission!!
c v2.04/Jan94-PAS: install nlat range controls.  Rework/clean/match h0
c    matrix routines.  Improve grid dimension checking. 1st cut isetdat
