c    "rhoofr" split out of "rhoofv" (itself cleaned/renamed "eigsolv").
c v2.00/12Jun93-PAS: rework declarations, trim unused arrays, rewrite
c    memory/file usage in setup/iters phases.  Reorganize setup phase
c    routines and their output (new routine "h0writ") to allow greater
c    control of files.  Continue effort to generalize dimensioning.
c    Combine into single routine (new routine "vesslo") generation of
c    slow electrostatic potential (formerly "fftrho" and "delvofr").
c    Rework branching structure of iteration phase for greater clarity.
c    Rewrite taking matrix elements off grid potentials (new routine
c    "vslomat" replacing "vmatrix").  All intrinsics replaced by
c    generics, except a couple DERFs, and I have purged chunks of
c    complex declarations, but lots (CMPLX,IMAG,etc) still litters code.
